      "object_role": "interpretation",
      "proposed_content": "This is goal-directed compression: retain the existence/count witness required by the finite-RH certificate and discard surplus coordinate precision. The simplification saves runtime and storage because a zero database and a completeness proof have different sufficient statistics.",
